### Exercise 7 — Semantic search with vector embeddings
#
# Run these with the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client, already recommended
# for this project): click "Send Request" above any request below. No shell needed — works
# the same on Windows, macOS, and Linux.
#
# `cds watch` must be running with the local embedding setup, searchTravels function, and
# handler from Exercise 7. First startup may wait for the embedding model download.
# Results and scores depend on your sample descriptions — compare the rankings for each query.

@host = http://localhost:4004
@auth = alice:

### Search by meaning — mountains & skiing
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/travel/searchTravels(q='skiing in snowy mountains')
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}

### Compare with a work-trip query
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/travel/searchTravels(q='corporate work conference meeting')
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
